@startuml
title Runenwerk UI Ownership and RunenUI Adoption Architecture

skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Retained Runenwerk Authority" {
  [Authored UI / ui_definition]
  [UiProgram Toolchain]
  [Story V2]
  [ui_composition]
  [ui_adaptive_composition]
  [App / Domain Mutation]
}

package "Current Predecessor Runtime" {
  [Local Retained UI]
  [ui_surface / ui_hosts]
  [Local Evaluator / Runtime View]
  [Current engine::plugins::ui runtime]
}

package "Explicit Adoption Boundary" {
  [Runenwerk Projection Adapter]
  [Runenwerk UI Integration Adapter]
}

cloud "Standalone RunenUI" as RunenUI {
  [View / Element]
  [Mounted Runtime]
  [Text / Layout / Interaction]
  [Paint / Hit / Semantics]
  [runenui_testing]
  [runenui_winit]
}

package "Runenwerk Product Edges" {
  [Native Host]
  [Runenwerk Render Adapter]
  [Editor / Draw / App]
}

[Authored UI / ui_definition] --> [UiProgram Toolchain]
[ui_composition] --> [Editor / Draw / App]
[ui_adaptive_composition] --> [Editor / Draw / App]
[UiProgram Toolchain] --> [Runenwerk Projection Adapter]
[App / Domain Mutation] <.. [Runenwerk UI Integration Adapter]

[Runenwerk Projection Adapter] --> [View / Element]
[View / Element] --> [Mounted Runtime]
[Mounted Runtime] --> [Text / Layout / Interaction]
[Text / Layout / Interaction] --> [Paint / Hit / Semantics]
[Mounted Runtime] --> [runenui_testing]

[Native Host] --> [runenui_winit]
[runenui_winit] --> [Mounted Runtime]
[Paint / Hit / Semantics] --> [Runenwerk UI Integration Adapter]
[Runenwerk UI Integration Adapter] --> [Runenwerk Render Adapter]
[Runenwerk UI Integration Adapter] --> [Editor / Draw / App]

[Story V2] ..> [Runenwerk Projection Adapter] : may orchestrate proof
[runenui_testing] ..> [Story V2] : owner-produced evidence

[Local Retained UI] ..> [Runenwerk Projection Adapter] : deleted per migrated consumer
[ui_surface / ui_hosts] ..> [Runenwerk UI Integration Adapter] : responsibilities split then deleted
[Local Evaluator / Runtime View] ..> [Runenwerk Projection Adapter] : retain only independent program semantics
[Current engine::plugins::ui runtime] ..> [Runenwerk UI Integration Adapter] : narrows to adapter

note bottom of [Retained Runenwerk Authority]
RunenUI does not own UiProgram, Story V2,
application composition, persistence,
provider policy, or app/domain mutation.
end note

note right of [Current Predecessor Runtime]
Current implementation remains authoritative
until a named consumer cut is accepted.
No migrated consumer may keep two
mounted/runtime authorities.
end note

note bottom of RunenUI
Standalone RunenUI owns reusable UI-framework
runtime semantics through public contracts.
end note

@enduml
